---
title: Chasing a stuck reindex into two unrelated bugs
date: 2026-08-07
summary: A routine cleanup — stop indexing job postings we can't categorize — sent us into a four-hour hang, a goroutine dump, and a real production outage from a week earlier we hadn't fully explained yet.
type: article
tags:
  - engineering
